ité pour l'épiderme et d'absorption percutanée de l'ingrédient actif: (I) dans laquelle au moins un de R1, R2 et R3 représente alkyle C1-20 linéair e ou ramifié, alkylcarbonylméthyle, alkoxycarbonylméthyle, allylalkyle, acyle, sulfate ou phosphate, tandis que le reste représente hydrogène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>